{"id":"wb-6-701","name":"淮口瑞光塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"淮口瑞光塔","text":"淮口瑞光塔，俗称白塔或淮口白塔，位于四川省成都市金堂县淮口镇沱江东岸的瑞光寺内。塔最初创建可追溯至东晋，可查始建年代为南宋绍兴十八年（1148年）。淮口瑞光塔2002年12月27日公布为四川省第六批省级文物保护单位。2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n淮口瑞光塔为方形十三层楼阁式砖塔，背靠蛇山、面向沱江方向坐东朝西。塔全高33米，设置须弥座塔基。塔内设实心塔柱，有蹬道133级，可达塔身内第十层。塔刹为铁铸，塔顶为四角攒尖顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B7%AE%E5%8F%A3%E7%91%9E%E5%85%89%E5%A1%94","revisionId":87010591,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87010591","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8a8e1387e1a2844348636b22.jpg","title":"淮口瑞光塔照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B7%AE%E5%8F%A3%E7%91%9E%E5%85%89%E5%A1%94%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/%E6%B7%AE%E5%8F%A3%E7%91%9E%E5%85%89%E5%A1%94%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Ruiguang Pagoda in Huaikou town","width":320,"height":470}}